OVERVIEW: Organization settings, usage, and billing.

USAGE: grantiva console org <subcommand>

OPTIONS:
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

SUBCOMMANDS:
  settings                Organization settings.
  usage                   Monthly active devices against the plan limit.
  billing                 Plan and billing period (read-only; manage billing in
                          the dashboard).

  See 'grantiva help console org <subcommand>' for detailed help.
